+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - `sync_domains` ensures desired domain bindings but does not remove stale upstream domain bindings no longer present in `service_domains`; that cleanup should be handled by a future reconciliation/delete-domain story if required.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - `dokploy_refs.yalla_kind` needed a new `service_domain` member because a single service can own multiple domain mappings; keying domain refs to the parent service would not support per-domain idempotent replay.
+  - The fake Dokploy server already supports `POST /api/domains` and `GET /api/domains/{id}`, so worker tests can cover domain provisioning without adding fake-server behavior.
+  - Queue redaction tests should claim a real persisted job through `StoreClaimer` to verify `error_summary` storage, not only call `Provisioner.Run` directly.
